sperados es 22,3, con un intervalo de confianza del 95 % de 12,1 a 44,4. En diciembre se adjudicó el 3 % de los contratos junto al límite, mientras que diciembre supone el 12 % de todos sus contratos de servicios y suministros. Los contratos junto al límite se reparten entre 9 adjudicatarios distintos. El contrato [1], de 14.991,88 euros, se adjudicó en diciembre de 2025.\nQué no pueden demostrar: El hecho de que se adjudiquen contratos cerca del límite no indica que haya habido irregularidades. Puede deberse a razones legítimas como precios de mercado o necesidades específicas. No implica que se haya partido ningún contrato ni que haya actuado mal alguien.\nQué se puede revisar: Es importante comprobar si los contratos [1] y [2] atienden la misma necesidad. También revisar si el adjudicatario A repite contratos por necesidades distintas. Verificar si los contratos de diciembre se distribuyen uniformemente entre los adjudicatarios.","en":"What the data shows: Between 2023 and 2025, this body awarded 58 minor contracts for services and supplies above 14,000 and up to 15,000 euros, just under the legal limit. If those amounts were spread as in the band immediately below, 2.6 contracts would be expected. The observed-to-expected ratio is 22.3, with a 95% confidence interval of 12.1 to 44.4. December accounts for 3% of the contracts just under the limit, compared with 12% of all its services and supplies contracts. The awardee with the most contracts just under the limit, called awardee A here, has 19. Contract [1], for 14,991.88 euros, was awarded in December 2025.\nWhat it cannot show: The concentration of contracts in December and the high number of contracts with one awardee do not prove improper conduct. These patterns could result from market conditions, budget constraints, or operational needs, not wrongdoing.\nWhat can be checked: Check the December contracts for consistency with other contracts and verify if the same awardee was used for similar services. Review the contract details for [1] to ensure it aligns with the body’s stated needs and budget constraints.","origen_es":"modelo","origen_en":"modelo","modelo":"Qwen3-4B (Q4_K_M, llama.cpp)","regla":"ss","citas":["FMA88DPIXffi0Kd8%2Brcp6w%3D%3D","wRUgSI0SiZokJPJS%2BPS9vg%3D%3D","tW3nOZrNK3c%2B1TMyIiZmzw%3D%3D"],"generado":"2026-11-15"}}